          <ul><li>Computer use for AI agents: see and operate desktop apps on macOS, Windows, and Linux through the OS accessibility tree.</li><li>Snapshots, clipboard reads, screenshots, command output, and debug artifacts can contain private desktop content. Keep them out of public logs and uploads.</li><li>agent-desktop status                # platform, permissions, supported surfaces</li><li>以上内容由 GitHub 公开 README 自动摘取和归纳，适合作为快速了解入口，深入实现仍以仓库源码和文档为准。</li></ul>
          <div class="mermaid">
flowchart LR
    User[用户 / AI 编程助手] --&gt; Client[Agent Client]
    Client --&gt; Protocol[MCP 协议层]
    Protocol --&gt; Server[vercel-labs/agent-desktop]
    Server --&gt; Tools[工具接口 / Skills]
    Server --&gt; Index[代码索引 / 知识图谱]
    Server --&gt; Data[文件系统 / API / 数据源]
    Tools --&gt; Result[结构化结果]
    Index --&gt; Result
    Data --&gt; Result
    Result --&gt; Client
    Client --&gt; Answer[生成回答 / 执行动作]
          </div>
        </section>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </main>
